    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="36">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 36</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XXXIII} Eac is funden: gif mon hafað spere ofer eaxle, ⁊ hine mon on asnaseð, gielde þone wer butan wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Likewise it is determined: if someone has a spear on [his] shoulder, and someone impales himself on it, let him pay the wer, without a fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">It is further enacted: if a man has a spear over his shoulder, and anyone is transfixed thereon, he shall pay the wergeld without fine.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XXXIII. Eac is funden: gif mon hafað spere ofer eaxle, ond hine mon on asnæseð, gilde þone wer buton wite.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
